# Generated validation artifacts — regenerable from the committed source
# (formulas.R + common.R + data_generation.r + the .rmd reports).
# data/ (goldens) is deliberately tracked: a missing golden silently
# re-freezes from the current engine, so deletion must be visible in git.
figures/
*.html
